    val MAP: Map<String, String> = mapOf(
        "Stand silently and listen to the imam. Do not recite al-Fatihah or a surah, whether he recites aloud or quietly." to "Indamay turib imomni tingla. Fotiha yoki surani ovoz chiqarib o‘qisa ham, ohista o‘qisa ham o‘qima.",
