        "Any surah you know may be recited. Keep the order of the Quran: the surah of the second rak‘ah should come after that of the first." to "Siz bilgan har qanday sura o'qilishi mumkin. Qur'on tartibiga rioya qiling: ikkinchi rak'at surasi birinchisidan keyin kelsin.",
        "Recite Bismillah, Surah al-Fatihah and another surah, as in the first rak‘ah." to "Birinchi rak'atdagi kabi Bismillah, Fotiha va boshqa suralarni o'qing.",
        "In Sunnah, Nafl and Witr a surah is added after al-Fatihah in every rak‘ah." to "Sunnat, Nafl va Vitrda har rakatda Fotihadan keyin bir sura qo'shiladi.",
        "Recite Bismillah and Surah al-Fatihah only. No surah is added in the third and fourth rak‘at of a Fard prayer." to "Faqat Bismillah va Fotiha suralarini o'qing. Farz namozining uchinchi va to‘rtinchi rakatlariga sura qo‘shilmaydi.",
        "Dua-e-Qunut" to "Dua-e-Qunut",
        "After the surah of the third rak‘ah, raise the hands {hands} saying Allahu Akbar, fold them again and recite Dua-e-Qunut quietly. Then go into ruku‘." to "Uchinchi rak'at surasidan so'ng {hands} \"Allohu akbar\" deb qo'llarni ko'taring, ularni yana buklang va \"Qunut\" duosini ohista o'qing. Keyin rukuga kiring.",
        "If you have not memorised it yet, recite ‘Rabbana atina…’ or say ‘Allahummaghfir li’ three times, and keep learning it." to "Agar hali yodlamagan bo'lsangiz, \"Rabbana atina...\" yoki \"Allohummag'fir li\"ni uch marta ayting va o'rganishda davom eting.",
        "Ruku‘" to "Ruku'",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and bow. Grip the knees with the fingers spread, keep the back level and the head in line with it. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Ollohu akbar deng va ta'zim qiling. Barmoqlaringizni yoyib, tizzalaringizni ushlang, orqa tekislikni va boshni u bilan bir tekisda saqlang. Tasbihni kamida uch marta o'qing.",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and bow only as far as the hands reach the knees. Rest the hands on the knees with the fingers together, keep the arms close to the body and do not straighten the back fully. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "“Allohu akbar” deng va faqat qo‘llar tizzaga yetguncha ruku qiling. Qo'llaringizni tizzangizga qo'ying, barmoqlaringizni birlashtiring, qo'llarni tanaga yaqin tuting va orqa tomonni to'liq to'g'rilamang. Tasbihni kamida uch marta o'qing.",
        "Qawmah (standing up)" to "Qavma (o'rnidan turib)",
