        "When the imam says Sami‘allahu liman hamidah, rise, stand fully upright and say only Rabbana wa lakal-hamd." to "Imom “Sami’allohu liman hamidah” desa, tur, to‘liq tik tur va faqat Rabbana va lakal-hamd, deb ayt.",
        "Pause until every joint has settled before going down." to "Pastga tushishdan oldin har bir bo'g'in joylashguncha pauza qiling.",
        "Two sajdahs" to "Ikki sajda",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and go down: knees first, then hands, then nose and forehead between the hands. Keep the elbows raised, the arms away from the sides, the belly away from the thighs, and the toes pressed towards the Qibla. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Allohu Akbar deb ayting va pastga tushing: avval tizzalar, keyin qo'llar, so'ngra burun va peshonani qo'llar orasiga. Tirsaklarni yuqoriga ko'tarib, qo'llarni yon tomonlardan, qorinni sonlardan uzoqda, oyoq barmoqlarini qiblaga qaratib qo'ying. Tasbihni kamida uch marta o'qing.",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and go down into sajdah drawn together: the arms resting on the ground close to the sides, the belly on the thighs and both feet turned out to the right. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "\"Allohu akbar\" deb ayting va birga sajdaga tushing: qo'llar erga yotgan holda yon tomonlarga yaqin, qorin va ikki oyog'i o'ngga buriladi. Tasbihni kamida uch marta o'qing.",
        "Rise with Allahu Akbar and sit upright for a moment (Jalsa). You may say Rabbighfir li." to "Ollohu Akbar bilan tur va bir zum tik o‘tir (Jalsa). Siz Rabbighfir li deyishingiz mumkin.",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and make the second sajdah in the same way." to "Allohu akbar deng va ikkinchi sajdani ham xuddi shunday qiling.",
