        "First sitting (Qa‘dah Ula)" to "Birinchi o'tirish (Qa'dah Ula)",
        "Recite only the Tashahhud." to "Faqat tashahhudni o'qing.",
        "Then stand for the third rak‘ah saying Allahu Akbar." to "Keyin uchinchi rakatga turib Allohu akbarni ayting.",
        "In four rak‘at of Sunnah Ghair-Muakkadah or Nafl, also recite Durood and dua here and begin the third rak‘ah with Thana. In Sunnah Muakkadah recite only the Tashahhud." to "G'ayr-muakkada yoki nafl sunnatining to'rt rak'atida bu erda Durud va duoni ham o'qing va uchinchi rak'atni Tana bilan boshlang. Sunnat Muakkadada faqat Tashahhudni o'qing.",
        "Final sitting (Qa‘dah Akhirah)" to "Yakuniy majlis (Qa’da Oxira)",
        "Recite the Tashahhud, then Durood-e-Ibrahim, then a dua." to "Tashahhudni, keyin Durud-i Ibrohimni, so'ngra duoni o'qing.",
        "Either of the two duas shown is enough." to "Ko'rsatilgan ikki duodan biri kifoya qiladi.",
        "Salam" to "Salom",
        "Turn the face to the right and say As-salamu ‘alaykum wa rahmatullah, then to the left and say it again. The prayer is complete." to "Yuzni o'ngga burib, Assalomu alaykum va rohmatulloh, so'ng chapga va yana ayting. Namoz tugallandi.",
