        "Taharah: the body, the clothes and the place of prayer are clean, and you are in wudu, or have made ghusl where it is due." to "Tahorat: Badan, kiyim va namoz o'qiladigan joy pok bo'lib, siz tahoratdasiz yoki lozim bo'lgan joyda g'usl qilgansiz.",
        "Satr-e-awrah: a man covers from the navel to below the knees; a woman covers her whole body except the face, the hands and the feet." to "Satr-i avrat: erkak kindikdan tizzasigacha yopadi; ayol yuzi, qo'llari va oyoqlaridan tashqari butun tanasini qoplaydi.",
