        "Reciting Surah al-Fatihah, and adding a surah or three short verses in the first two rak‘at of Fard and in every rak‘ah of Witr, Sunnah and Nafl." to "“Fotiha” surasini o‘qish, farzning birinchi ikki rak’ati va vitr, sunnat va naflning har bir rak’atida bir sura yoki uch qisqa oyat qo‘shish.",
