        "Qa‘dah Ula, the first sitting in a three- or four-rak‘at prayer, and reciting the full Tashahhud in both sittings." to "Qa'da Ula, uch yoki to'rt rak'at namozda birinchi o'tirish va har ikki majlisda ham tashahhudni to'liq o'qish.",
